Work in progress

Automation framework using Page Object Model (POM) and Gherkin syntax with Pytest-BDD

Steps to run:
py -3.14 -m venv venv
.\venv\Scripts\Activate.ps1
pip install -r requirements.txt
pytest -s -v

Need Appium server and Android emulator for now.

Select the target platform with the TEST_DEVICE env var (defaults to ANDROID).
Capabilities are defined in config/capabilities.yaml; page objects per platform live
under pages/mobile/<platform>/. To add iOS, implement pages/mobile/ios/*.py and
register the classes in pages/mobile/pages.py under PAGE_CLASSES["iOS"].